nch, Czech, Danish, and Chinese)","Barcodes/Labels generator for parts and storage locations, scan barcodes via webcam using the builtin barcode scanner","User system with groups and detailed (fine granular) permissions."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"03d68200052ead73925f212cab05488e54b3eb81f636c30dc00f653614159806","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:33:02.544Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:33:02.544Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Part-DB is an Open-Source inventory management system for your electronic components. It is installed on a web server and so can be accessed with any browser without the need to install additional software.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You can log in with username: user and password: partdb-demo.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Access Part-DB in your browser (under the URL you put it) and log in with user admin.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"03d68200052ead73925f212cab05488e54b3eb81f636c30dc00f653614159806","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:33:02.544Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T05:14:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T23:53:03.878Z","hash":"03d68200052ead73925f212cab05488e54b3eb81f636c30dc00f653614159806","originalBytes":10752,"storedBytes":10752,"truncated":false},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:54.142Z","latestRelease":{"name":"Part-DB 2.19.2","tag":"v2.19.2","publishedAt":"2026-09-28T22:57:58Z","url":"https://github.com/Part-DB/Part-DB-server/releases/tag/v2.19.2"},